docs/gpt/GPT_TASK_QUEUE.md-4-start, `DONE <date> — branch gpt/<name>` when finished. One branch per task. The rules
docs/gpt/GPT_TASK_QUEUE.md-5-in `/AGENTS.md` bind every task. Nothing here ships directly — a task is DONE when the
docs/gpt/GPT_TASK_QUEUE.md:6:GPT gauntlet is clean and the branch is pushed; the harness's cross-family panel merges.
