docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-154-
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-155-**The mechanic everyone missed: you are billed per audio token, not per minute of open session.**
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-156-OpenAI does not charge for connection time. With push-to-talk, audio streams *only while the button
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-157-is held*. **Silence, thinking time, and reading the text log cost $0.** The spec's error was billing
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md:158:every wall-clock minute of a 2-hour session as a fully-saturated conversational minute. A real
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-159-builder session is maybe **15–25% audio-active**.
