docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-402-common phoneme, easily false-triggered by the word "chief" in speech and by radio/podcast audio.
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-403-Use a longer, rarer phrase: **"hey chief command"** or **"okay chief."**
