docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-411-   did"* answers hands-free, locked, in-pocket, with **zero background mic.** Doesn't open a
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-412-   conversation — answers a question. **Spec as the follow-on; it covers most pocket use.**
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-413-3. **Native capture layer** (`AVAudioSession(.playAndRecord)` + `AVAudioEngine` tap + interruption/
