docs/gatekeeper-task11-spec.md:4:**Owner ask:** "Build the gatekeeper — the one service that holds merge, deploy and spend."
docs/gatekeeper-task11-spec.md:9:gatekeeper is the single service that holds those powers instead — agents *ask*, it
docs/gatekeeper-task11-spec.md:36:  shape, in the wrong place. It should be *asking the gatekeeper*, not writing usage.
docs/gatekeeper-task11-spec.md:39:  grants approvals today.** That is the gatekeeper's job.
